# ⚠⚠ NO GAME FILES. EVER. This repo carries findings, addresses and formats -- never EA's data.
# Master's rule, 2026-09-21: "no gamefiles". The reader is BYO-disc: it runs against a copy the
# user already owns and never ships one.
